#: ../../source/changelog.rst:43 96dcf6bb63f143e5ba25040e8dfc44bd
msgid ""
"Removes ``PosSizeContext``, ``set_pos_size_handler``, and ``ExecSignal``;"
" use `Strategy.enable_rotation "
"<https://www.pybroker.com/en/latest/reference/pybroker.strategy.html#pybroker.strategy.Strategy.enable_rotation>`_"
" / `RotationContext "
"<https://www.pybroker.com/en/latest/reference/pybroker.context.html#pybroker.context.RotationContext>`_."
msgstr ""
"移除 ``PosSizeContext``、``set_pos_size_handler`` 和 ``ExecSignal``；改用 "
"`Strategy.enable_rotation "
"<https://www.pybroker.com/en/latest/reference/pybroker.strategy.html#pybroker.strategy.Strategy.enable_rotation>`_"
" / `RotationContext "
"<https://www.pybroker.com/en/latest/reference/pybroker.context.html#pybroker.context.RotationContext>`_。"

#: ../../source/changelog.rst:45 b34b615d752549cba00134e40a9b7aba
msgid ""
"Deprecates ``ExecContext.score`` and ``StrategyConfig.max_*_positions``; "
"use `long_score "
"<https://www.pybroker.com/en/latest/reference/pybroker.context.html#pybroker.context.ExecContext.long_score>`_"
" / `short_score "
"<https://www.pybroker.com/en/latest/reference/pybroker.context.html#pybroker.context.ExecContext.short_score>`_"
" and `set_max_long_positions "
"<https://www.pybroker.com/en/latest/reference/pybroker.strategy.html#pybroker.strategy.Strategy.set_max_long_positions>`_"
" / `set_max_short_positions "
"<https://www.pybroker.com/en/latest/reference/pybroker.strategy.html#pybroker.strategy.Strategy.set_max_short_positions>`_."
msgstr ""
"弃用 ``ExecContext.score`` 和 ``StrategyConfig.max_*_positions``；改用 "
"`long_score "
"<https://www.pybroker.com/en/latest/reference/pybroker.context.html#pybroker.context.ExecContext.long_score>`_"
" / `short_score "
"<https://www.pybroker.com/en/latest/reference/pybroker.context.html#pybroker.context.ExecContext.short_score>`_"
" 以及 `set_max_long_positions "
"<https://www.pybroker.com/en/latest/reference/pybroker.strategy.html#pybroker.strategy.Strategy.set_max_long_positions>`_"
" / `set_max_short_positions "
"<https://www.pybroker.com/en/latest/reference/pybroker.strategy.html#pybroker.strategy.Strategy.set_max_short_positions>`_。"

#: ../../source/changelog.rst:47 62bcaa2a65fb4f5daf1e123826722bea
msgid ""
"Unifies `slippage "
"<https://www.pybroker.com/en/latest/reference/pybroker.slippage.html>`_ "
"API; removes ``RandomSlippageModel``."
msgstr ""
"统一 `slippage "
"<https://www.pybroker.com/en/latest/reference/pybroker.slippage.html>`_ "
"API；移除 ``RandomSlippageModel``。"

#: ../../source/changelog.rst:49 f2d0f04c6f36448eb2570e8799464188
msgid ""
"Removes ``bootstrap_sample_size``; BCa and drawdown bootstrap now "
"resample the full backtest series instead of a fixed-size sample, fixing "
"cases that could produce incorrect confidence intervals or degenerate to "
"a single replicate."
msgstr ""
"移除 ``bootstrap_sample_size``；BCa "
"自助法与回撤自助法现在对完整的回测序列进行重新抽样，而不再使用固定大小的样本，修复了此前可能导致置信区间错误或退化为单次抽样的问题。"

#: ../../source/changelog.rst:51 8ee0c084bbad4f5f8ef46141c9295184
msgid ""
"Removes ``disable_parallel`` from `backtest "
"<https://www.pybroker.com/en/latest/reference/pybroker.strategy.html#pybroker.strategy.Strategy.backtest>`_"
" / `walkforward "
"<https://www.pybroker.com/en/latest/reference/pybroker.strategy.html#pybroker.strategy.Strategy.walkforward>`_;"
" parallel indicator and model work is opt-in via ``parallel_indicators`` "
"/ ``parallel_models``."
msgstr ""
"从 `backtest "
"<https://www.pybroker.com/en/latest/reference/pybroker.strategy.html#pybroker.strategy.Strategy.backtest>`_"
" / `walkforward "
"<https://www.pybroker.com/en/latest/reference/pybroker.strategy.html#pybroker.strategy.Strategy.walkforward>`_"
" 中移除 ``disable_parallel``；并行化的指标和模型计算改为通过 ``parallel_indicators`` / "
"``parallel_models`` 按需启用。"

#: ../../source/changelog.rst:53 0da33c59bd88444caacb8faf894d0d59
msgid ""
"``result.positions`` is opt-in via `StrategyConfig.record_position_bars "
"<https://www.pybroker.com/en/latest/reference/pybroker.config.html#pybroker.config.StrategyConfig.record_position_bars>`_;"
" full ``Portfolio.bars`` snapshots are opt-in via `record_portfolio_bars "
"<https://www.pybroker.com/en/latest/reference/pybroker.config.html#pybroker.config.StrategyConfig.record_portfolio_bars>`_."
msgstr ""
"``result.positions`` 通过 `StrategyConfig.record_position_bars "
"<https://www.pybroker.com/en/latest/reference/pybroker.config.html#pybroker.config.StrategyConfig.record_position_bars>`_"
" 按需启用；完整的 ``Portfolio.bars`` 快照通过 `record_portfolio_bars "
"<https://www.pybroker.com/en/latest/reference/pybroker.config.html#pybroker.config.StrategyConfig.record_portfolio_bars>`_"
" 按需启用。"

#: ../../source/changelog.rst:55 323bc29d7d2c4cee8c566909adabaf20
msgid ""
"Removes ``akshare`` from install dependencies; install it separately to "
"use `AKShare "
"<https://www.pybroker.com/en/latest/reference/pybroker.ext.data.html#pybroker.ext.data.AKShare>`_."
msgstr ""
"从安装依赖中移除 ``akshare``；如需使用 `AKShare "
"<https://www.pybroker.com/en/latest/reference/pybroker.ext.data.html#pybroker.ext.data.AKShare>`_，请单独安装。"

#: ../../source/changelog.rst:57 92804ad0c35b4fd7a9b945afdc2ca1c7
msgid ""
"Fixes the `Calmar Ratio "
"<https://www.pybroker.com/en/latest/reference/pybroker.eval.html#pybroker.eval.calmar_ratio>`_"
" to the standard definition of annualized return (CAGR) divided by "
"maximum drawdown percentage; it previously annualized arithmetically and "
"measured drawdown on the cumulative sum of per-bar returns."
msgstr ""
"将 `卡玛比率（Calmar Ratio） "
"<https://www.pybroker.com/en/latest/reference/pybroker.eval.html#pybroker.eval.calmar_ratio>`_"
" 修正为标准定义：复合年增长率（CAGR）除以最大回撤百分比；此前是按算术方式年化，并基于逐 K 线收益率的累计和衡量回撤。"

#: ../../source/changelog.rst:59 537af763e32d4e1eb4feb363fd0c2ead
msgid ""
"Fixes the `Ulcer Index "
"<https://www.pybroker.com/en/latest/reference/pybroker.eval.html#pybroker.eval.ulcer_index>`_"
" to measure drawdowns from the running peak over the whole equity curve, "
"and the `Ulcer Performance Index "
"<https://www.pybroker.com/en/latest/reference/pybroker.eval.html#pybroker.eval.upi>`_"
" to use the annualized (CAGR) return when ``bars_per_year`` is set; "
"passing a ``period`` to the functions keeps the previous trailing-window "
"behavior."
msgstr ""
"将 `溃疡指数（Ulcer Index） "
"<https://www.pybroker.com/en/latest/reference/pybroker.eval.html#pybroker.eval.ulcer_index>`_"
" 修正为基于整条权益曲线、相对其滚动最高点衡量回撤，并将 `溃疡表现指数（Ulcer Performance Index） "
"<https://www.pybroker.com/en/latest/reference/pybroker.eval.html#pybroker.eval.upi>`_"
" 修正为在设置 ``bars_per_year`` 时按复合年增长率（CAGR）计算收益；向这两个函数传入 ``period`` "
"可保留此前的滚动窗口行为。"

#: ../../source/changelog.rst:61 8de20a6ca1194bceb78ed0ff8691445d
msgid ""
"Fixes ``unrealized_pnl`` in `EvalMetrics "
"<https://www.pybroker.com/en/latest/reference/pybroker.eval.html#pybroker.eval.EvalMetrics>`_,"
" which previously understated unrealized PnL by the total fees paid (per-"
"trade PnL is gross of fees while market values are net of them)."
msgstr ""
"修复 `EvalMetrics "
"<https://www.pybroker.com/en/latest/reference/pybroker.eval.html#pybroker.eval.EvalMetrics>`_"
" 中的 ``unrealized_pnl``：此前它会被已支付的总手续费低估（逐笔交易盈亏未扣除手续费，而市值则已扣除手续费）。"

#: ../../source/changelog.rst:63 efb0175f6b6d40ca955d617f13334942
msgid ""
"`annual_total_return_percent "
"<https://www.pybroker.com/en/latest/reference/pybroker.eval.html#pybroker.eval.annual_total_return_percent>`_"
" now counts ``n`` bar values as ``n - 1`` return intervals when "
"annualizing."
msgstr ""
"`annual_total_return_percent "
"<https://www.pybroker.com/en/latest/reference/pybroker.eval.html#pybroker.eval.annual_total_return_percent>`_"
" 现在在年化时将 ``n`` 个 K 线数值视为 ``n - 1`` 个收益区间。"

